    "summary": "Friendly **SCOUT SENTINEL** and **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY SMOKE** units gain **Signal Flares**: in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), the unit may pick 1 **visible** enemy unit up to 12\" away. The picked unit becomes **designated**, and while **designated** it has +3\" **detection range**.\n\nIt carries the **RECON** tag, so it cannot be combined with another **RECON** **detachment**.",
